# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF, whatever the editor or agent wrote. Edits on Windows kept
# rewriting whole files to CRLF (five times across specs 008-011), which buried the real change in the diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.webm binary
*.m4a binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
